    "title": "Launcher OS\u2122",
    "description": "Launcher OS\u2122 sets a new standard for the Android mobile operating system. It makes your phone better than before. And now it opens up to amazing possibilities for launcher on your phone. With Launcher OS\u2122, Your phone is the most powerful, personal, and intelligent devices they've ever been.\r\n\r\nTo make Launcher OS\u2122 working most perfectly. You must grant some special permissions like to:\r\n- CAMERA: Open camera in your phone when screen is locked.\r\n- READ_PHONE_STATE: Show phone call when screen is locked.\r\n- NOTIFICATION ACCESS: Show notification when screen is locked.\r\n- READ/WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE: Support wallpaper set from your storage and our server save image.\r\n- DRAW OVER SCREEN: Show Lock Screen in over all application\r\n\r\nIf you have any problem, please contact me via email support@appsgenz.com\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR USING MY APPLICATION!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Launcher OS\u2122 sets a new standard for the Android mobile operating system. It makes your phone better than before. And now it opens up to amazing possibilities for launcher on your phone. With Launcher OS\u2122, Your phone is the most powerful, personal, and intelligent devices they&#39;ve ever been.<br><br>To make Launcher OS\u2122 working most perfectly. You must grant some special permissions like to:<br>- CAMERA: Open camera in your phone when screen is locked.<br>- READ_PHONE_STATE: Show phone call when screen is locked.<br>- NOTIFICATION ACCESS: Show notification when screen is locked.<br>- READ/WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE: Support wallpaper set from your storage and our server save image.<br>- DRAW OVER SCREEN: Show Lock Screen in over all application<br><br>If you have any problem, please contact me via email support@appsgenz.com<br><br>THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR USING MY APPLICATION!",
